# Privy App ID — get one at https://dashboard.privy.io
# Set this in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables (name must start with NEXT_PUBLIC_).
# If left empty, the site falls back to a plain injected-wallet (MetaMask) connect
# button so it still builds, deploys, and works before Privy is configured.
NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVY_APP_ID=
